abstract: "Dated public statistical observations, explicitly hypothetical teaching scenarios, calculation scripts, fifteen baseline tables, fourteen figures and two orientation maps accompanying the 27 October 2026 book baseline of Ethiopia and the Coast, with a disclosed Figure 1 and reference correction issued 27 October 2026. Numerical inputs are unchanged. These materials are not a site-specific feasibility study or an estimate of a causal maritime-access effect. Author data and documentation use CC BY 4.0; original code uses MIT. Third-party data retain their stated terms."
